{"id":"slice-1","type":"text","x":360,"y":0,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"**Slice 1: record canvases.** Each record opens as a canvas with a card for each section."},
{"id":"slice-2a","type":"text","x":360,"y":200,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"**Slice 2a: canvas files.** Boards like this one, drawn from `.horsemen/canvas/`."},
{"id":"slice-2b","type":"text","x":720,"y":0,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"**Slice 2b: players and tables.** Video and document players that load on click, and CSV tables."},
{"id":"slice-3","type":"text","x":720,"y":200,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"4","text":"**Slice 3: agent tools.** A local MCP server with `read` and `canvas_edit`, and a short hook pointer."},
{"id":"slice-4","type":"text","x":1080,"y":0,"width":320,"height":360,"color":"4","text":"**Slice 4: edit in the browser.** Each save is one commit by the person who saves.\n\n- 4a: add, move, connect, and remove cards.\n- 4b: drop or paste images, tables, and links.\n- 4c: a protected branch saves to `horsemen/canvas` with a pull request link."},
{"id":"why","type":"file","x":0,"y":0,"width":320,"height":160,"file":"VISION.md","subpath":"#The world we are building"}
